  "collectionNotes": [
    "独立 WROOM-32U / IP101G RMII 数字路径已验证：MDIO PHY1、真实 LX6 MAC 增强 descriptor DMA 发送 ARP 并将 VirtualNet 应答写入客体 RAM；支持显式原始以太网 relay。ESP-AT 出厂应用、物理 PoE 转换与无线射频未验收。",
    "未验证独立 PCB 布局/板级 CAD，保留可展开的 UNKNOWN 主板；外壳、纸贴、镜头与连接器分别着色。",
    "原照片/丝印版权归 M5Stack，未确认独立开放图片许可；近似几何按项目许可，厂家 CAD 保留原 MIT。",
    "本轮未进行浏览器 WebGL 正反斜视/三种材质真实渲染验收；资产加载、几何、UV、材质隔离与展开复位另做离线检查。",
    "接口位置/插合深度和逐脚物理方位未独立标定，禁用可连接线缆；不能以近似插口当电气路由。",
    "精确原厂 CAD 为26×72×19.2mm，排版副本未混入装配；RJ45金属/触点、Grove和可见单枚紧固件为照片估算。",
    "文档 Model Size 链接文件名为U129，与U138身份不符；未将该尺寸图当U138测量依据。",
    "Native -Z/16.4mm-wide recess carries the circuit diagram from photo2; +Z/18.8mm-wide recess carries PoESP32 branding from photo6. These distinct carriers are verified separately rather than swapping their printed sides.",
    "Diagram paper is a single independent masked surface: the photographed RJ45 metal shield is estimated below the plastic-CAD cutout. Paper-to-plastic/metal display clearances0.05/0.025mm prevent z-fighting; hidden shield dimensions are not verified component CAD. Branding ROI uses the measured full-body crop with a conservative real-paper-edge inset, never projects to side/inner faces.",
    "exact native U138 manufacturer case plus photo-estimated sockets"
  ]
}
